FINAL REVIEW
The first harness receiver was improved, but the sandbox still stalled on FastAPI’s anyio worker-thread handoff. A diagnostic health request timed out there. Retrying the same artifact/API verification outside the sandbox passed without application changes.
PASS: each selected-retrain state-dict tensor exactly equals the independently saved 16,16 sweep tensor.
Controlled 32,32 comparison: raw train=16.517593, validation=16.834801; normalised train=4.388602, validation=5.510101 days. Normalised validation MAE is 9.489899 days lower than the user’s 15-day prediction.
16,16 has the lowest observed validation MAE among the ten fixed-seed models and 385 parameters; 64,64 uses 4609 parameters with slightly worse validation MAE. No accuracy was traded away on this split.
Selected train MAE 4.815988 and validation MAE 5.308265 give a 0.492277-day gap. The 64,64 gap is 1.609487 days despite lower training error and no validation gain, consistent with greater overfitting. Poorer single-layer runs have high training and validation error, so their larger MAEs alone are not evidence of overfitting. Single-seed results do not establish robust rankings.
Shared preprocessing computes per-feature population statistics from training X only, with float64 accumulation and saved float32 values. Zero standard deviation becomes one. Validation/test inputs use these same saved values. Validation statistics never fit the transform.
Feature order verified: battery_v, temp_c, rings_per_day, wifi_rssi_dbm, age_months. JSON key order does not affect inference order.
Commands: experiments/mission2.py runs the eleven unique experiments and chosen retrain; commands.sh records each invocation; experiments/verify_mission2.py verifies all saved pairs and the fresh API. Installed versions are recorded in package_versions.json.
API transport for this mission’s checks: fresh in-process ASGI requests, not a public endpoint check. Mission 3 will verify serving and external latency.
User was asked to estimate unseen MAE after selection; no estimate supplied yet. Codex estimate is 7 days, informal and unmeasured. Reusing validation for ten-model selection can make its score optimistic.
Reviewed source diff, exact unchanged cleaning/split, all experiment metrics, plot, and API outputs. Fetched origin; no teammate divergence. Ordinary push to main will be used. Mission 2 complete.
